          "Lead with affluent suburban economic security: at $113,631 income with 52.6% college attainment, this constituency evaluates on education quality, healthcare costs, property tax fairness, and whether local government is responsive and efficient — not partisan orthodoxy; candidates who speak with specificity to these material concerns outperform those who default to party messaging.",
