          "Lead with material governance concerns: property tax fairness, school funding adequacy, housing affordability for renters and young families, and local infrastructure investment are the issues that actually affect this district's daily life. Younger professionals and families in the district are evaluating whether government is delivering on these basics — not abstract partisan positioning.",
