          "Engage the 32.3-year median age cohort specifically on economic mobility and early-career stability: student debt, first-time homebuying barriers, childcare costs, and dual-income household economic security are the material concerns of a young, educated, high-income constituency that evaluates on whether government is removing obstacles to their life outcomes.",
          "Build authentic constituent relationships with the 11% Asian and 10% Hispanic communities through specific policy engagement and regular presence — these constituencies are large enough to swing a seat and engaged enough (given education and income levels) to organize when they feel unserved by incumbent-assumed loyalty.",
