          "Build specific constituent relationships with the 9.58% Asian and 3.21% Hispanic communities; in a district where the dominant story is affluent Anglo and Asian professionals, other constituencies can become invisible and their economic mobility and healthcare access concerns warrant direct legislative attention.",
          "Treat 39% Republican support as a genuine swing constituency of high-income professionals persuadable on fiscal competence and governance effectiveness; any candidate who campaigns this seat as ideologically safe risks allowing a credible challenger to consolidate educated, affluent voters who remain open to persuasion on economic stewardship."
