          "Lead on school quality and education funding with specificity: the 47.2% college-educated professional base has children in or about to enter the K-12 system, and this constituency evaluates representatives on whether schools are well-funded, maintaining high standards, and accessible to all families regardless of income; this is a core issue where Republican governance can credibly compete if the argument centers on efficient spending and local control rather than austerity.",
