          "Develop a specific agenda for young professionals' economic security beyond progressive messaging: student debt, childcare costs, healthcare access, and the pathway from educational credentials to economic stability are the practical concerns of a 32.8-year-old, 72.1% college-educated, high-income-but-rent-dependent constituency that expects its representative to deliver on these specifics."
