          "Recognize that unopposed status does not indicate permanent coalition durability: any challenger who mounts a campaign with specific policy engagement on education, housing, healthcare, or taxation could credibly contest this seat if the incumbent has not built authentic constituent relationships across the district's educated, economically sophisticated, and increasingly diverse population."
