          "Lead with homeowner economic security and school quality: the $105,749 income, 34.9% college attainment, and homeowner-dominant profile mean property-tax fairness, school funding, and housing-value protection are the primary economic concerns of the electoral base. Deliver measurable results on these issues or risk redistribution of support among college-educated voters who evaluate on governance performance, not partisan inheritance.",
