          "Build constituent infrastructure beyond the unopposed cycle: use the breathing room of an unopposed term to conduct explicit outreach to renters, Hispanic residents, and younger adults on their material concerns — healthcare access, housing costs, education quality — before a Democratic challenger arrives with that infrastructure already in place."
