          "Lead with housing affordability and renter protection: at 55.8% renter rate and $68,386 median income, housing cost burden is the primary household budget constraint for the constituency. Rent stabilization, eviction protection, and tenant rights legislation are not peripheral issues—they are central to whether working families feel represented. Legislative results on housing should be the centerpiece of any member's record-building in this seat.",
          "Engage Latino economic mobility with specificity: the 61.14% Latino population and 22.1% college attainment together signal a constituency whose primary pathway to economic security is wage growth and job quality in industries where Latino workers are concentrated (service, construction, healthcare, retail). Payano's legislative agenda should reflect concrete engagement with Latino small business support, apprenticeship and skilled trade pathways, and wage standards in Latino-majority sectors.",
