          "Build active constituency service operations in communities of color: with 11.21% of residents being Hispanic, Asian, or Black, the representative's relationship with these communities cannot default to Democratic identification but must include specific attention to economic mobility, anti-discrimination enforcement, and whether government services are reaching them — treat this as core constituent engagement, not outreach.",
