          "Lead on housing affordability and renter protections: at $103,484 income with 42.6% renters, this district contains both aspiring homeowners and established renters for whom housing costs are material concerns. Specific legislative work on property tax fairness, eviction protection, and zoning policy demonstrates responsiveness beyond abstract Democratic positioning.",
          "Engage the Asian constituent community with specificity on economic mobility, education access, and healthcare policy: at 19.29% of the district, Asian voters are the second-largest demographic group and represent professional networks and business communities that can organize alternative support if they conclude the incumbent is not serving their priorities.",
