          "Engage Black and Hispanic communities as the constituency core with specific economic mobility commitments: educational access, workforce development pipelines, small business support, healthcare quality, and equitable employment opportunity are the material governance priorities that these communities evaluate. Service to 69% of the district requires infrastructure and legislative focus proportional to their share of the population.",
          "Build authentic young adult engagement on opportunity: the 33.5-year median age in a high-cost metro area describes a constituency that evaluates on wage growth, housing affordability, educational pathways, and whether careers are sustainable in the region. Government that does not address these material concerns risks losing the engagement of a cohort that has other options and limited patience for rhetoric without results.",
